{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lenscraft Cube is a minimalist platformer puzzle game. In this game, you play as a small cube, starting with mechanisms designed around boundaries to solve puzzles. Each game mechanism is simple and easy to understand, allowing you to fully unleash your imagination to find the path to the end.<br><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist Aesthetics: Construct challenging puzzle worlds with simple geometric shapes; each scene is simple yet aesthetically pleasing.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boundary Puzzle Solving: Original &quot;Camera Vision&quot; mechanism, allowing you to manipulate objects or change gravity direction by adjusting perspective.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857360/extras/3b6e7d34a85e051d147f5fa83d7b317b.poster.avif?t=1754407431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857360/extras/3b6e7d34a85e051d147f5fa83d7b317b.webm?t=1754407431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857360/extras/3b6e7d34a85e051d147f5fa83d7b317b.mp4?t=1754407431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857360/extras/e6a16f6e3cc5996181ab8dcc25ef9be7.poster.avif?t=1754407431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857360/extras/e6a16f6e3cc5996181ab8dcc25ef9be7.webm?t=1754407431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857360/extras/e6a16f6e3cc5996